Maintain speed 280 knots or greater for separation.

258
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:43,380
Cross CK at 35 or later.

259
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,860
Cross DG at 24 or earlier.

260
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:54,000
Do not exceed 280 knots.

261
