We are too low to the surrounding terrain. Confirm we are still being radar vectored.

294
00:30:00,300 --> 00:30:03,430
Confirm we are still above your minimum vectoring altitude.

295
00:30:05,970 --> 00:30:11,480
Right heading 040 until passing FL70 then direct to BK.

296
00:30:14,020 --> 00:30:18,040
Direct to JO, descend to FL50.

297
00:30:20,580 --> 00:30:22,630
Passing FL70.

298
00:30:25,170 --> 00:30:32,770
Descending to 4000 feet QNH1005, expect ILS approach Runway 24.

299
00:30:35,310 --> 00:30:38,790
Request straight-in ILS approach Runway 24.

300
00:30:41,330 --> 00:30:49,370
Cleared straight-in ILS approach Runway 24, descend to 3000 feet, QNH1011.

301
00:30:51,910 --> 00:30:54,810
Airfield in sight, request visual approach.

302
00:30:57,350 --> 00:31:00,620
When established on the localizer, descend on the glide path.

303
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:05,110
Established on the localizer.

304
00:31:07,650 --> 00:31:10,180
Fully established Runway 24.

305
