Cleared VOR-DME approach Runway 24, descending to 3000 feet QNH1007.

306
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:26,330
Runway in sight.

307
00:31:28,870 --> 00:31:32,940
Number One, contact Tower 118.7.

308
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:37,000
Passing outer marker.

309
00:31:39,540 --> 00:31:42,280
Report MQR outbound.

310
00:31:44,820 --> 00:31:47,970
Procedure turn completed, localizer established.

311
00:31:50,510 --> 00:31:52,380
Request visual approach.

312
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:57,450
Cleared visual approach Runway 24.

313
00:31:59,990 --> 00:32:01,750
Request holding instructions.

314
