Hold over BKM VOR at FL100, inbound track 280 degrees, left hand pattern, outbound time 1 minute.

315
00:32:17,330 --> 00:32:19,130
Request holding procedure.

316
00:32:21,670 --> 00:32:36,790
Hold on the 265 radial of BKM VOR between 25 and 30 miles DME, FL100, inbound track 085, right hand pattern, expected approach time 1022.

317
00:32:39,330 --> 00:32:51,780
Hold at 20 DME of ST VOR, FL100, inbound track 260 degrees, left turns, limiting outbounddistance 24 DME.

318
00:32:54,320 --> 00:32:59,240
Overhead YV, maintaining 3000 feet, entering hold.

319
00:33:01,780 --> 00:33:05,760
Leaving BKM VOR heading 110.

320
00:33:08,300 --> 00:33:15,710
Leaving FL60, descending to 2500 feet, QNH1008.

321
00:33:18,250 --> 00:33:21,780
Position 10 miles north east of LN.

322
00:33:24,320 --> 00:33:27,230
Turn right heading 180 for base leg.

323
00:33:29,770 --> 00:33:37,010
Reduce to minimum approach speed, turn right heading 230, cleared for ILS approach Runway 27.

324
00:33:39,550 --> 00:33:44,550
No ATC speed restrictions. Contact Tower 118.9.

325
00:33:47,090 --> 00:33:49,220
Three sixty turn left for delay.

326
00:33:51,760 --> 00:33:55,410
Continue present heading, expect through the localizer for spacing.

327
00:33:57,950 --> 00:34:02,690
Surveillance radar approach Runway 27, maintaining 2200 feet.

328
00:34:05,230 --> 00:34:10,890
QNH1003, threshold elevation 196 feet.

329
00:34:13,430 --> 00:34:22,210
Precision radar approach Runway 27 heading 260, descending to 2500 feet, QNH1014.

330
00:34:24,750 --> 00:34:28,150
Cleared to JEMMY via BK-1A Arrival.

331
00:34:30,690 --> 00:34:34,620
Descend to reach 5000 feet by BK.

332
00:34:37,160 --> 00:34:43,650
When ready, descend to FL200. Report leaving FL300.

333
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:49,620
Descend immediately FL250.

334
00:34:52,160 --> 00:34:56,980
Descend to altitude 12000 feet QNH 1000.

335
00:34:59,520 --> 00:35:04,830
Descend to height 2000 feet QFE 997 hectopascals.

336
00:35:07,370 --> 00:35:11,430
Descend to 8000 feet at 1000 feet per minute or greater.

337
00:35:13,970 --> 00:35:18,580
Maintain own separation and VMC, descend to FL50.

338
00:35:21,120 --> 00:35:22,940
Increasing rate of climb.

339
